{"id":"msg_m_ex_all_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_ex_all","label":"Outpost Group Chat · Group"},"label":"3. A missive from the Observatory.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_all_02","next":"msg_m_ex_all_04","speakers":{"delta":"Delta","anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon","rapi":"Rapi"},"icons":{"delta":"si_c020_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_all_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_1","text":"A missive from the Observatory.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_2","text":"It has come to our attention that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_3","text":"a certain subsection of people in the Outpost are doing the defense work,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_4","text":"while others are often slacking off.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_5","text":"We ask that everyone pitch in","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_6","text":"and please carry out the orders given to them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_7","text":"What? Who's slacking off?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_8","text":"Who could do such a thing?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_9","text":"If you ask me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_10","text":"I think this is a case of the one who smelled me, dealt it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_11","text":"Hey, I didn't fart!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_12","text":"Don't you mean \"thou doth protest too much?\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_13","text":"Oh yeah, that. Close enough, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_14","text":"Either way, the fact that Anis is the culprit doesn't change.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_15","text":"Very true.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_16","text":"Hey!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_17","text":"How come I'm the only one in the crosshairs?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_18","text":"Because I was referring to","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_19","text":"one person in particular.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_20","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_21","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_22","text":"Really.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_23","text":"... It's me, isn't it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_24","text":"Precisely.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_25","text":"Most surprising.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_26","text":"Jeez...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_27","text":"I didn't know I was hanging out with such a bunch of squares.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_28","text":"Hehe...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_29","text":"Sorry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_30","text":"I'll report to the Defense Outpost more.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_31","text":"How often?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_32","text":"Yeah, how often?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_33","text":"Good grief, I need to decide that too?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_34","text":"Fine, I'll go three times a day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_35","text":"Breakfast, lunch, and dinner.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_36","text":"Nah, it should be at least five times a day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_37","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_37","text":"Totally.","jump":"m_ex_all_03_39"},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_38","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_38","text":"Make it six.","jump":"m_ex_all_03_39"},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_39","text":"What did I ever do to you people?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_40","text":"Why are you being like this, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_41","text":"Let's make it three times.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_42","text":"Five might be overdoing it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_43","text":"T_TT_TT_TT_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_44","text":"RapiT_TT_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_45","text":"I always knew you are the only one I could trust.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_46","text":"However, you'll have to do it for at least three days in a row.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_47","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_48","text":"Three whole days?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_49","text":"... I'm never going to make it out of this alive.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_50","text":"Don't worry, I'll be joining you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_51","text":"You will???","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_52","text":"There isn't any reason for you to go, is there, Rapi?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_53","text":"Consider it my punishment for neglecting to properly oversee one of my co-workers.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_54","text":"Hmm, when you put it that way,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_55","text":"I feel like I better tag along too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_56","text":"Hey, this'll be great!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_57","text":"A nice team-building exercise for the Counters.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_58","text":"Come on, Neon!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_59","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_60","text":"I changed my mind. I don't wanna go.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_61","text":"Consider it an opportunity to enhance your firepower.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_62","text":"?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_63","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_63","text":"You certainly know how to appeal to Neon's sensibilities.","jump":"m_ex_all_03_65"},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_64","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_64","text":"That's a low blow, bringing up firepower.","jump":"m_ex_all_03_65"},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_65","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_66","text":"Did you say... firepower?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_67","text":"She certainly did!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_68","text":"Like, firepower firepower?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_69","text":"Yes, firepower firepower!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_70","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_70","text":"She's officially won over.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_71","text":"It's settled! I'm going!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_72","text":"For the sake of Counters' firepower!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_73","text":"Delta, please adjust the base defense schedule.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_all_03_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"delta","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_all_03_74","text":"Will do.","jump":null}],"chat":true}